        "name": "Death Mark",
        "maxRank": 3,
        "summary": "Zed becomes untargetable and dashes to an enemy champion, marking them. After 3 seconds the mark triggers, repeating a portion of all the damage Zed dealt to the target while they were marked.",
        "bodyHtml": "Zed becomes Untargetable and dashes to an enemy champion, marking them. After 3 seconds, the mark triggers, dealing <span class=\"text-red-600 dark:text-red-500 font-semibold\">(100% Attack Damage) physical damage</span> and repeating 25/40/55% of all damage dealt to the target by Zed while the mark was active.<br /><br />The dash leaves a <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Shadow</span> behind for 7.5 seconds. Zed can <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-300\">Recast</span> this Ability to switch positions with this <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Shadow</span>.<br /><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">Untargetable units won't be affected by enemy Attacks or Abilities unless they've already been hit by them.</span><br /><span class=\"text-gray-600 dark:text-gray-400 italic\">The <span class=\"text-yellow-600 dark:text-yellow-400 font-semibold\">Shadow</span> remains for an extra 1.5 seconds after the recast window ends.</span>",
